===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|ahia}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|nan-hbl|阿兄|tr=á-hiaⁿ|t=eldest brother}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|áhiya|hmp=Ahiya}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|áhiyá|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|Chinese Filipino|colloquial}}

# [[elder brother]]; [[big brother]]
#: {{syn|tl|kuya}}
#: {{ux|tl|Ano nga ulit sabi sa iyo ng '''ahiya''' mo?|What did your '''big brother''' tell you again?}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|author=Bai Ren|editor=Joaquin Sy|title=Lagalag sa Nanyang: (Nanyang Piaoliuji)|location=Quezon City|publisher=The Univeristy of the Philippines Press|year=2007|pages=157|pageurl=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=VsG7EMyYfzUC&printsec=frontcover&dq=inauthor:%22Ren+Bai%22&hl=en&sa=X&redir_esc=y#v=onepage&q&f=false|passage=Halos mahibang si Fely sa pag-ibig kay A Chuan. Madalas niya akong kuwentuhan ng tungkol sa relasyon nila ni Ahia. Wala siyang ipinaglihim sa akin. Isang pambihirang lalaki ang '''ahia''' ko, aniya, matapang na'y maginoo pa. Guwapo rin ako, aniya, kamukha ni Ahia. Alam kong sa pagpuri niya sa aki'y pinupuri rin niya ang lalaking iniibig.|t=Fely almost got crazy with love for A Chuan. She frequently tells stories about their relationship with Big Brother. She held no secrets from me. My '''big brother''' is one extraordinary guy, and according to her, brave and noble too. I am handsome too, a lookalike of my big brother, she said. I know that her compliments to me also compliments her beloved guy as well.}}
# {{n-g|[[term of address]] for one's elder brother}}
#: {{syn|tl|kuya}}
#: {{ux|tl|Ano nga ulit sabi sa iyo ni '''Ahiya'''?|What did '''Brother''' tell you again?}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|author=STUPIDLYINLOVE|title=Bitter Casanova|location=Mandaluyong|publisher=Summit Publishing Co., Inc.|year=2019|pages=18|pageurl=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=M59kEAAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover#v=onepage&q&f=false|passage="OMG, Achi! Tinawagan ka ni '''Ahia''' Dustin?!" Natigilan ako. "Sshhhh!" suway noong isa. "Oooops!" At humagikhik naman 'yong isa. Nagpasimpleng tumingin naman ako sa likod ko kung nasaaan sila at nakita ko namang nag-ngingitian na mukhang sira iyong dalawang 'yon habang nagbubulungan pa.|t="OMG, Big Sister! '''Big Brother''' Dustin called you?!" I was silenced. "Sshhhh!", hush by one. "Oooops!"and the other one giggled. I then subtly looked over my back on where they were and I saw those two smiling looking stupid while also whispering.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|author=Teresita Ang See; Caroline Sy-Hau; Joaquin Sy|title=Voices ; Mga Tinig|location=Manila|publisher=Kaisa Para Sa Kaunlaran|year=1997|pages=156|pageurl=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=0pxkAAAAMAAJ&dq=%22ahia%22+%22mga%22&focus=searchwithinvolume&q=%22ahia%22|passage=Pagkaraang maiabot ko kay '''Ahia''' ang tiket at diyaryo, naisipan ko na ring tumingin sa numero at sa halagang nakalimbag. Ang dalawang matanda ay nakibasa na rin.|t=After I was able to hand the ticket and newspaper to my '''Big Brother''', I thought as well to look at the numbers and the values printed. The two old people read with me as well.}}
# {{lb|tl|informal}} {{n-g|[[term of address]] for a [[male]] [[senior]] {{q|usually within the Chinese Filipino community}}}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Ahiya''', paano po ba ito?|'''Bro''', how do I do this?}}

====Coordinate terms====
* {{s|female}} {{l|tl|atsi}}

====Related terms====
{{rel3|tl|Ahiya|kuya|diko|sangko|siko|dihiya}}

