|passage=Pero napabalikwas silang lahat ng gising dahil sa sunud-sunod na mga '''alulong''' sa kabi-kabila. Ano &#39;yun? Ano &#39;yun? Bumangon din ang giya. At ipinaliwanag na iyon ay alulong ng mga usa. Love call. Pahatid ng mga mensahe ng pag-ibig at&nbsp;...|t=But they were all turned by wakefulness because of the consecutive howls left and right. What's that? What's that? The guard rose up too. And explained that was a howl of deer. Love call. Something brought by the messages of love and...}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1988|title=Philippine Journal of Education
|passage=Maling salita: Nakakikilabot ang tahol ng aso. Tamang salita : Nakakikilabot ang '''alulong''' ng aso. MABUTING PAGPAPAHAYAG - Narito ang bahagi ng isang kwentong pambatang natanggap namin: &quot;Tinanaw ni Tonio ang maluwang na ilog.|t=Wrong word: The bark of the dog was terrifying. Correct word: The '''howl''' of the dog was terrifying. GOOD STATEMENT - Here is the part of one child story we received. &quot;Tonio viewed the wide river.}}
