Page 895 -an: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|-han}}
* {{alt|tl|-nan}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*-an}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*-an}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*-an}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr}}

===Suffix===
{{tl-verb|b=+|b2=an}}

# {{n-g|object trigger}}: to do something to a person or a thing
#: {{uxi|tl|Buks'''an''' mo ang pinto.|(You) open the door}} {{q|'''door''' is focused).}}
# {{n-g|object trigger}}: to cause something to become; to make
#: {{uxi|tl|Binagal'''an''' ni Sue ang kotse.|Sue slowed down the car.}} {{q|'''The car''' is focused.}}
# {{n-g|directional trigger}}: to do something in the (physical or psychological) direction of
#: {{uxi|tl|Tinitingn'''an''' ko ang manwal.|I'm looking at the manual.}} {{q|'''The manual''' is focused).}}
# {{n-g|benefactive trigger}}: to do something for
#: {{uxi|tl|Titir'''han''' ko si Roy ng keyk.|I'll leave some cake for Roy.}} {{q|'''Roy''' is focused).}}
# {{n-g|object trigger}}: {{q|with root word reduplication}} to do something occasionally, at random, a little, a bit, now and then or here and there
#: {{uxi|tl|Winawalis-'''walisan'''; ko ang sahig.|I'm sweeping the floor a bit.}} {{q|'''The floor''' is focused).}}
# {{n-g|directional trigger}}: {{q|with root word reduplication}} to do something in the (physical or psychological) direction of, occasionally, at random, a little, a bit, now and then or here and there
#: {{uxi|tl|Tinutulung-'''tulungan''' ni Jessy si Patty.|Jessy helped Patty a bit.}} {{q|'''Patty''' is focused).}}
# {{n-g|object trigger}}: to perform the action of the verb on something
#: {{uxi|tl|Huwag mong sulat'''an''' ang dokumento.| Don't write anything on the document.}}

===Suffix===
{{tl-noun|b=+|b2=an}}

# {{n-g|Forms locative nouns expressing where a large quantity of the thing meant by the root is put, planted, or can be found}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|aklat|t1=book|aklatan|t2=library}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|basura|t1=trash|basurahan|t2=trash can}}
# {{n-g|Forms locative nouns where the action expressed by the root is performed}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|kain|t1=eat|kainan|t2=place where people eat e.g. restaurant, café,...}}
# {{n-g|Forms nouns expressing period in which the action expressed by the root is collectively performed}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|ani|t1=harvest|anihan|t2=harvest time}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|pasok|t1=entry, class, work|pasukan|t2=school time, school year}}
# {{n-g|Forms nouns indicating a tool or an object that is used to perform what is meant by the root}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|oras|t1=time|orasan|t2=clock, watch}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|timbang|t1=weight|timbangan|t2=weighing scale}}
# {{n-g|Forms nouns signifying reciprocal or joint performance of the action expressed by the root}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|sayaw|t1=dance|sayawan|t2=dancing together}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|kanta|t1=sing|kantahan|t2=singing together}}
# {{n-g|Used to create a diminutive, pretensive, or imitative form of something}} {{qualifier|used with reduplication of root word}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|bahay|t1=house|bahay-bahayan|t2=toy house}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|Diyos|t1=God|diyos-diyosan|t2=false god}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|baril|t1=gun|baril-barilan|t2=toy gun}}

===Suffix===
{{tl-adv|b=+|b2=an}}

# {{lb|tl|appended to numbers}} {{n-g|Used to indicate groups.}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|tatlo|t1=three|tatluhan|t2=in threes, three at a time}}
#: {{suffixusex|tl|dalawampu|t1=twenty|dalawampuan|t2=in groups of twenty, twenty at a time}}

====Usage notes====
* Normally, {{IPAchar|/h/}} is inserted before ''-an'' when a root word ending with a vowel is not followed by a glottal stop. In some cases, phoneme change can occur and {{IPAchar|/h/}} becomes {{IPAchar|/n/}}.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|ganti|[[gantihan|ganti'''h'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|talo|[[talunan|talu'''n'''an]]}}
* Sometimes, the final vowel of the root word disappears when the suffix is added.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|sunod|sundan}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|takip|takpan}}
* Due to [[allophony]], {{IPAchar|/d/}} turns into {{IPAchar|/r/}} when inserted before ''-an''.
*: {{suffixusex|tl|buklod|[[bukluran|buklu'''r'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|bakod|[[bakuran|baku'''r'''an]]}}
*: {{suffixusex|tl|bayad|[[bayaran|baya'''r'''an]]}}

====Derived terms====
{{suffixsee|tl}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|tl|ka- -an}}

-------- end text --------
