Page 968 anim: -------- begin text --------
{{number box|tl}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|tl|phi-pro|*ənəm|*aʔənəm}}, from {{der|tl|poz-pro|*ənəm|*a-ənəm}}, from {{der|tl|map-pro|*ənəm|*a-ənəm}}. Compare {{cog|pam|anam}}, {{cog|bcl|anom}}, {{cog|ceb|unom}}, {{cog|mrw|nem}}, and {{cog|ms|enam}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|audio=TL-PH-anim.ogg}}

===Numeral===
{{tl-num|b=+}}

# [[six]]
#: {{syn|tl|seis}}

====Usage notes====
* To describe the quantity of something, the number is placed before the noun and affixed with a '''-ng''' when the word ends with a vowel, and a separate word '''[[na]]''' for a consonant.
*: '''''Isang''' saging, '''dalawang''' pinya''
*: '''''Apat na''' mansanas, '''anim na''' mangga''

====Derived terms====
