#* {{quote-journal|tl|text=Baka hindi pala ako pasok diyan. '''Awts gege''' na lang lods!|volume=1|issue=1|journal=Beam|year=2022|publisher={{w|University_of_the_Philippines|UP Association of Civil Engineering Students}}|location=Quezon City|page=13|pageurl=https://issuu.com/upaces-beam/docs/feb-jul-2022-issue/13|title=Mr. Kupido, Do Your Thing!|author=N.R.A. Perez; X.Y. Villena |translation=Maybe I don't fit here. Just '''awts gege''' instead, guys!}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=D_tcEAAAQBAJ&pg=PA183&dq=%22awts%20gege%22|title=That Golden Boy|author=Jay-Jay Destro|publisher=Ukiyoto Publishing|isbn=9789355971432|year=2022|page=183|passage="'''Awts gege'''," tuod kong sabi dahil hindi ko na alam kung anong gagawin ko.|chapter=Awts Gege |translation="'''Awts gege'''," what I really said since I do not know what I'm going to do.}}
