===Etymology===
From {{bor-lite|tl|es|b}}. Each pronunciation has a different source:
* Filipino alphabet pronunciation is influenced by {{der-lite|tl|en|b}}.
* Abecedario pronunciation is from {{der-lite|tl|es|b}}.
* Abakada alphabet pronunciation is influenced by Baybayin character {{m-lite|tl|ᜊ|sc=Tglg|tr=ba}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyph-lite|tl|b}} <!-- {{hyph|tl|b}} -->
