* {{sense-lite|letter name|Abecedario}} {{IPA-lite|tl|/be/|[bɛ]}} <!-- {{tl-IPA|be}} -->
* {{sense-lite|letter name|Abakada alphabet}} {{IPA-lite|tl|/ˈba/|[ˈbɐ]}} <!-- {{tl-IPA}} -->
* {{sense-lite|phoneme}} {{IPA-lite|tl|/b/|[b]}} <!-- {{tl-IPA}} -->
* {{rhymes-lite|tl|i|e|a|s=1}}

===Letter===
{{head-lite|tl|letters|lower case||upper case|B|Baybayin spelling|ᜊᜒ|f3sc=Tglg|cat2=terms with Baybayin script}}

