# {{lb|tl|historical}} {{Latn-def-lite|tl|letter|2|be|alphabet name={{w|Filipino orthography#Adoption of the Latin script|Abecedario}}}}

===Letter===
{{head-lite|tl|letters|lower case||upper case|B|Baybayin spelling|ᜊ|f3sc=Tglg|cat2=terms with Baybayin script}}

# {{Latn-def-lite|tl|letter|2|ba|alphabet name={{w|Abakada alphabet}}}}

