Page 1775 bahala: -------- begin text --------
{{numberbox|tl}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|sa|भार|t=[[burden]]; [[load]]; [[weight]]}}.<ref>{{R:tl:Potet|TBC|page=276}}</ref> Compare {{cog|pam|bala}}, {{cog|ceb|bala|alt=bála / baláha|t=to carry something on the back, not tied}},<ref>{{R:Wolff 1972}}</ref> {{cog|ms|bahara|t=weight}},<ref>{{R:PRPM|bahara}}</ref><ref>{{cite-book|author=Jose G. Kuizon|title=The Sanskrit Loan-Words in the Cebuano-Bisayan Language|url=https://nirc.nanzan-u.ac.jp/nfile/646|publisher=University of San Carlos|location=Cebu City|page=118|year=1964}}</ref> and {{cog|jv|ꦧꦫ||hundred million}}. Otherwise, it may also possibly be from {{m|tl|Bathala}}, which was from {{der|tl|sa|भट्टार|t=[[revered]], [[worshipful]]}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|bahalà}}
* {{hyph|tl|ba|ha|la}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|bahalà|b=+}}

# [[responsibility]]
# ː {{syn|tl|responsabilidad}}
# [[person]] [[responsible]]
#: {{syn|tl|tagapangasiwa|katiwala|patnugot|tagapangalaga|tagapamahala}}
# [[management]]; [[custody]]; [[charge]]
#: {{syn|tl|pangangasiwa|pamamatnubay|pamamatnugot}}
# [[apprehension]]; [[presentiment]]

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|bahala ka|bahala na|bahalain|kabahala|ipagsawalang-bahala|pagsasawalang-bahala|sawalang-bahala|kawalang-bahala|mabahala|ipabahala|ikabahala|mamahala|pabahala|pabahalaan|pagkabahala|pamahalaan|pamamahala|tagapamahala|walang-bahala|bigay-bahala|magbigay-bahala|bigyang-bahala|pagbigyang-bahala|may bahala|ibigay-bahala|makapagbigay-bahala|makabahala|tulakbahala}}

