From {{bor|tl|ms|bingka|t=cake made of rice flour, coconut milk, eggs and plum sugar}} with initial {{reduplication|tl||nocap=1}}. The genitalia sense is borrowed from {{bor|tl|ceb|bibingka||female genitalia}}. Compare {{cog|tsg|bibingka}} and {{w|Philippine Spanish|Philippine}} {{cog|es|vivinca}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+,bibingká|new=1}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|+|head2=bibingká|b=+}}

# {{l|en|bibingka}} {{gl|rice cake made from rice, coconut, and grated coconut, and wrapped in coconut leaves}}
# {{lb|tl|vulgar|slang}} [[female]] [[genitalia]]
#: {{syn|tl|puke}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|tl|bibingkahan}}

{{C|tl|Foods}}
-------- end text --------
