* {{desc|pam|bor=1|bihag}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|alipin|bilanggo|talandak}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|bihág|b=+}}

# [[captured]]; [[captive]]
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[alive]] {{gl|[[animal]] or [[plant]]}}
#: {{syn|tl|buhay}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''bihag''' pa|still '''alive'''|inline=1}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|mabihag|pagkabihagan|bihagin}}

