===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|map-pro|*bilaŋ|t=to count, calculate; hold valuable}}. Compare {{cog|kaw|wilaṅ}}, {{cog|mrw|bilang}}, and {{cog|ms|bilang}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|+<n^><audio:Tl-ph-bilang.ogg>|biláng<a^><audio:Tl-ph-biláng.ogg>|new=1}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[number]] {{gl|counting}}
#: {{ux|tl|Malaki ang '''bilang''' ng mga nakiluksa para kay Dating Pangulong Cory Aquino.|There was a '''large number''' of people who mourned for Former President Cory Aquino.}}
# [[count]]; [[amount]]
# [[act]] of [[count]]ing
# condition of [[belong]]ing or being [[part]] of something
#: {{ux|tl|Hindi ka '''nabibilang''' sa pangkat.|You are not '''part''' of the group.|lit=You don't '''count''' on the group.}}
# {{lb|tl|Batangas}} [[dowry]]
#: {{syn|tl|bigay-kaya|dote}}

