|passage="Talagang bastos kang '''bruha''' ka! Siguro wala kang pinag-aralan kaya ganyan ka. Maski buhay mo kaya kong bilhin."
|translation="You rude '''witch'''! Maybe you haven't learned manners so to be like that. I can buy even your life."}}
