Page 3209 Bulacan: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|Bulakan||proscribed}}

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|tl|bulak|an}}, {{m|tl|bulak}} either referring to {{cog|tl|bulaklak|gloss=flower}} or {{cog|tl|bulak|gloss=cotton}} or {{cog|tl|burak|gloss=mud}}. Formerly the town of {{m|tl|Bulakan}}, formerly a [[visita]] of {{m|tl|Tondo}}. See also {{m|tl|bulakan||''Decalobanthus peltatus''}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|bulakán}}
* {{hyph|tl|Bu|la|can}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|Bulacán|b=+}}

# {{place|tl|province|c/Philippines|t1=[[Bulacan]]}}

====Usage notes====
According to a 2007 Bulacan provincial government ordinance, the spelling ''Bulacan'' is reserved for the province, while the spelling {{m|tl|Bulakan}} is used for the municipality.

====Related terms====
* {{l|tl|Bulakenyo}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{pedia|lang=tl}}
-------- end text --------
