===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|ms|jurubahasa|t=interpreter}}, from {{af|ms|juru-|t1=expert|bahasa|t2=language|nocat=1}}. The first element was {{der+|tl|jv|ꦗꦸꦫꦸ|t=expert|nocap=1}}, from {{der|tl|kaw|juru|t=head, leader, chief; tradesman}}, while the second element was {{der+|tl|sa|भाषा|nocap=1}}. The pronunciation was possibly {{glossary|contamination|conflated}} with {{m|tl|hasa}}. Compare {{cog|mrw|diyarobasa}} and {{cog|tsg|julbahasa}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|dalubhasà}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|dalubhasà|b=+}}

# [[expert]]; [[specialist]]
#: {{syn|tl|eksperto|pantas|perito|bihasa}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[interpreter]]
#: {{syn|tl|tagasalin|tagapagsalin|interprete|traduktor}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} act of [[interpretation]]
#: {{syn|tl|saysay|interpretasyon}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|dalubhasaan|kadalubhasaan|dalub-|magdalubhasa|ipagdulubhasa|dalubsining}}

====Related terms====
