#: {{syn|tl|kuno|dikuno|umano|diumano}}
#: {{ux|tl|Marunong '''daw''' siya.|'''They say''' he is wise.}}

====Usage notes====
* When the preceding word ends with a vowel, {{angbr|w}}, or {{angbr|y}}, {{m|tl|raw}} is used instead, but the distinction isn't always made. Other words with this phenomenon include {{m|tl|dito}}, {{m|tl|diyan}}, {{m|tl|doon}}, and {{m|tl|din}}.

