# {{lb|tl|derogatory}} [[woman]] who have been [[dishonored]] by being [[raped]] or [[give birth|having given birth]] [[out of wedlock]]
#: {{syn|tl|laspag}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1992|title=Hugot sa sinapupunan
|text=Pawang personal na isyu ang ibinato sa akin, mula sa pagiging '''disgrasyada''' hanggang sa pagkakaroon ng pangit na reputasyon. Pero walang ibinunga ang maruruming taktika ng kabilang kampo {{nb...}}|t=They mostly threw personal issues to me, from me having '''given birth out of wedlock''' to having a bad reputation. But nothing came out of the dirty tactics from both camps}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1998|author=Benigno Ramos|title=Gumising ka, aking bayan: mga piling tula
|text=Sa mga tulang ito, pinag-ukulan niya ng pansin ang babaeng '''desgrasyada''', ang babaeng inalipin at pinagsamantalahan, o ang babaeng kinasangkapan at naging puta.|t=In these poems, he paid attention to the '''disgraced woman''', the woman who has been enslaved and abused, or the woman turned into an instrument and become a whore.}}

