# [[maybe]]; [[might]]; [[probably]]; [[seemingly]]
#: {{syn|tl|baka|tila|yata|marahil|tila|para|anaki}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Diwa''' darating siya ngayon?|She '''may be''' arriving today?}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Diwa''''y pinawawalan mo na akong halaga.|'''It appears''' as if you do not put importance on me.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Diwa''' nga'y gayon ang nangyari.|'''Perhaps''' that is really what happened.}}

====Usage notes====
