#: {{syn|tl|kaya}}
#* {{quote-journal|1=tl|year=1972|publisher=Liwayway Pub.|journal=Liwayway|url=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/Liwayway/O4znAAAAMAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=ergo|page=44|text=Simple lang ang kanilang pinanghahawakan: ang daigdig ng mga materya ay sa demonyo, ang daigdig ng espiritu ang sa Diyos. '''Ergo''', iwasan ang daigdig ng materya.|t=What they uphold is simple: the material world is for the Devil, the spiritual world is God's. '''Ergo''', avoid the material world.}}
#* {{quote-book|1=tl|year=1998|author=Virgilio S. Almario|title=Kalahating siglo sa ibabaw ng mundo at mga kataka-takang: alaala't engkuwentro|isbn=9712707296|page=93|text=Ang isang dahilan, magulo kasi tayo. Hindi magkaisa; puro kudeta at rebelyon. '''Ergo''', ang kailangan nati'y isang diwang magbibigkis sa atin.|t=One reason is that we are disorderly. We can't unite; we are always on coup d'état and rebellion. '''Ergo''', what we need is a consciousness that unites us.}}
#* {{quote-book|1=tl|year=2017|author=Jubert Cabrezos|publisher=AuthorHouse|title=Naturalismo|isbn=1546209549|text='''Ergo''', ang paglikha ng kaalaman ay may dalawang daan|t='''Therefore''', there are two ways for the creation of knowledge}}
#* {{quote-web|1=tl|date=27 April 2020|author=Baby E|title=Performers ng comedy bar umaaray na, Noel Cabangon humihingi na rin ng tulong|work=Pang-Masa - Palaban, Maaasahan (Philstar.com)|url=https://www.philstar.com/pang-masa/pang-movies/2020/04/27/2010072/performers-ng-comedy-bar-umaaray-na-noel-cabangon-humihingi-na-rin-ng-tulong|text='''Ergo''', wala rin silang kita.|t='''Therefore''', they also don't have income.}}

