** {{IPA-lite|tl|/ˈʔepe/|[ˈʔɛ.pɛ]}} <!-- {{tl-IPA|epe}} -->
* {{sense-lite|phoneme}}
** {{IPA-lite|tl|/f/|[f]}} <!-- {{tl-IPA|f}} -->
