* {{R:KWF Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1860|120|'''GANGSA'''. pc. {{l|es|ganso}}.}}
* {{R:Vocabulario de la lengua tagala 1613|328|Ganſo) Gangſa [(pc)] C. grande [que los] traen [de china]}}
* {{R:CEDOF|3|133}}
* {{R:tl:Potet|TBC|page=282}}

{{C|tl|Geese}}
