* {{R:tl:Pinoy Dictionary}}
* Jovita Ona Calixihan, ''Filipino-English Figures of Speech'' ({{ISBN|9712718557}}, 2007): "very eager, raring to do something"
* Ed Lim, ''LIM Filipino-English English-Filipino Dictionary'': "trembling"
* ''Tuttle Concise Tagalog Dictionary'' ({{ISBN|1462914950}}, 2017): "trembling because of anger or fondness"
