Page 5948 haba: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From Greater Central Philippine ''*habaʔ'' (“long (object)”). Compare {{cog|ilo|akaba}}, {{cog|pam|kaba}}, {{cog|hnn|aba}}, {{cog|bcl|laba}}, {{cog|akl|haba}}, {{cog|hil|laba}}, {{cog|tsg|haba'}}. See also the coincidentally similar {{ncog|ja|-}} {{ja-r|幅|はば}}.<ref>{{R:tl:Potet|TBC|page=344}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|habà<n^length; extent of time>|habâ<a^long and narrow><n^garfish>|new=1}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|habà|b=+}}

# [[length]]; [[lengthiness]]
#: {{syn|tl|kahabaan}}
# [[extent]] of [[time]]
#: {{syn|tl|tagal|luwat}}
# [[long]] [[duration]] of [[time]]
#: {{syn|tl|katagalan|kaluwatan}}

