{{der3|tl|kahabaan|kahab-an|kasinghaba|habaan|pahabain|habaaan|habang|hinaba-haba|humaba|magkasinghaba|kasinghaba|magpahaba|mahaba|pagkamahaba|paghaba|pagpapahaba|habambuhay|habambuhay na pagkabilanggo|habang-panahon|habang-daan}}

===Adjective===
