# [[long]] and [[narrow]]; [[elongate]]
#: {{syn|tl|pahaba|taluhaba}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|parihaba|taluhaba|tighaba}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|habâ|b=+}}

# [[garfish]]
#: {{syn|tl|isdang-haba}}

