#: {{syn|tl|sabsab|hakhak|lablab|laklak|pagsabsab}}
# [[biting]] in the [[manner]] of a [[toothless]] [[person]] {{gl|as if with one's lips}}
#: {{syn|tl|ngabngab|pagngabngab|kabkab}}
# [[violent]] [[attack]] by a [[quadruped]] [[animal]] {{gl|snout first, especially of pigs or dogs}}
