#: {{prefixusex|tl|i-|tapon|t2=throw|itapon|t3=to throw}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Itapon''' mo iyan sa basurahan.|Throw that to the garbage.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|instrumental trigger}}: to use something for a certain purpose {{gl|expresses various kinds of actions}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|i-|sulat|t2=write|isulat|t3=to use something for writing}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Isulat''' mo ng listahan ang lapis.|Use the pencil to write a list.}}

