Page 7938 kalayaan: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|calayaan||obsolete|Abecedario orthography}}
* {{alt|tl|kalayahan||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|tl|laya|ka- -an}}. Used by {{w|Marcelo H. del Pilar}} in 1882 (originally as {{m|tl|kalayahan}}) as an equivalent for {{noncog|es|libertad||liberty}} in his Tagalog translation of {{w|José Rizal}}'s ''El Amor Patrio''. The word was then used in 1886 by Rizal for his search for an equivalent for {{noncog|de|Freiheit||freedom; freehood}} while translating {{w|Friedrich Schiller}}'s drama, ''{{w|William Tell (play)|William Tell}}''. Later adopted by the [[Katipunan]] to articulate their separatist ideology against the [[Spanish]] [[Empire]].

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|kalaya7an<n^freedom; liberty><audio:Tl-PH-kalayaan.ogg>|kalaya7án<n^libertinage, self-abandonment>|new=1}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[freedom]]; [[liberty]]
#: {{syn|tl|kamaharlikaan|katimawaan|q1=archaic|q2=archaic}}
#: {{ux|tl|[[ipaglaban|Ipinaglaban]] ng mga Katipunero ang ating '''kalayaan''' mula sa mga Kastilang sumakop sa bansa.|The Katipuneros fought for our '''freedom''' from the Spaniards who conquered (our) land.}}
#: {{ux|tl|Dumating ang bakasyong [[tag-init]], at [[galak]] na galak ang bulilit na si Yan-Yan sa natamo nitong '''kalayaan''' mula sa [[paaralan]].|Summer vacation came, and little Yan-Yan was overjoyed for finally earning '''freedom''' from school.}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|Araw ng Kalayaan}}

====Related terms====
{{rel3|tl|Kalayaan}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|kasarinlan|kaligtasan}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|kalayaán|b=+}}

# [[libertinage]]; [[self]]-[[abandonment]]
#: {{syn|tl|pagpapabaya|libertinahe}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
* {{R:Diksyunaryo tesauro Pilipino-Ingles 1973|page=623}}
* {{cite-book|first=Virgilio S.|last=Almario|title=Rizal: Makata|date=2014-11-14|publisher=Anvil Publishing, Inc.|url=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/Rizal/NTWWDwAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=kalayaan&printsec=frontcover&pg=PT150|isbn=978-971-27-2951-5}}
* {{cite-book|title=Bagong kasaysayan: Ang Kartilya ni Emilio Jacinto at ang Diwang Pilipino sa agos ng kasaysayan|year=1999|publisher=Palimbagang Kalawakan|url=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/Bagong_kasaysayan_Ang_Kartilya_ni_Emilio/NJ5uAAAAMAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=kalayaan&printsec=frontcover}}
* {{cite-book|tl|author=José Rizal|title=Mga ibaʼt ibang sinulat ni Rizal, 1873-1892|year=1964|publisher=Pambansang Komisyon ng mga Bayáni|url=https://www.google.com.ph/books/edition/Mga_iba%CA%BCt_ibang_sinulat_ni_Rizal_1873_1/etFRAQAAMAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=%22kalayahan%22|author2=National Heroes Commission}}

