#: {{syn|tl|hinliliit}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[bound]]; [[boundary]]; [[confine]]; [[limit]]
#* {{quote-book|tl|url=https://books.google.com.ph/books?id=J77kDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA45&dq=wala+ka+pa+sa+kalingkingan&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwj6lajY_K31AhX7sFYBHcvsD1oQ6AF6BAgIEAI#v=onepage&q=wala%20ka%20pa%20sa%20kalingkingan&f=false|year=2016|title=That Promdi Girl: Book 3|author=owwSIC|page=45|text=Kumpara sa'yo, 'yang hinanakit mo, wala pa sa '''kalingkingan''' ng mga hinanakit na naranasan ko.|t=Compared to you, that [[hurt#Noun|hurt]] in you, it's not yet at the '''bounds''' of the [[hurt#Noun|hurt]] I experienced.}}

