#* {{quote-book|1=tl|year=1981|publisher=College of Arts and Sciences, University of the Philippines|title=The Diliman Review, Volumes 29-30|page=|text=Kaya mo bang maglaba ng sarili mong '''karsonsilyo'''?|t=Are you capable of washing your own '''underpants'''?}}
#* {{quote-book|1=tl|year=1988|publisher=Kilusan sa Paglilinang ng Rebolusyonaryong, Panitikan at Sining sa Kanayunan (LINANG)|title=Sa tungki ng ilong ng kaaway: talambuhay ni Tatang|page=37|text=Ang ginagawa ko tuwing ako'y maliligo, lalabhan ko ang '''karsonsilyo''' at kamiseta at oras na matuyo ang mga ito ay huhubarin ko na yaong pantalon ko para huwag agad masira.|t=What I do every time I take a bath is wash my '''underpants''' and my shirt and once they are dry I take off those pants of mine so that it will not immediately wear out.}}
#* {{quote-book|1=tl|year=2010|publisher=Goodwill Trading Co., Inc.|title=Diksyunaryong Tagalog|isbn=9715741541|text=Maayos na tiniklop ang mga '''karsonsilyo'''.|t=The '''underpants''' are nicely folded.}}
