#: {{syn|tl|kasi naman|gawa kasi}}

====Preposition====
{{tl-prep|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|Tayabas|Marinduque|sometimes|followed|by|{{l|tl|ay}}}} [[owing to]]; [[because of]] {{gl|{{n-g|an expression used to blame or make something or someone responsible for things that happened; it can also be used satirically}}}}
#: {{syn|tl|palibhasa|gawa kasi|kasi naman}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Kawasa''' sa iyo, 'di ka kaagad natulog nang maaga, tinanghali ka tuloy ng gising.|'''That's because of''' [your doing]; you didn’t go to bed early, which is why you woke up late.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Kawasa''''t matalino ako kaya nasagutan ko 'yun.|'''Owing to''' I'm smart, that's why I was able to answer it.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Kawasa''', alam mong madami akong bitbit, sa akin mo pa pinadala, kaya huwag mo 'kong sinisisi dini.|'''That’s because of''' [your doing], knowing I have so many loads, but you still made me carry those things, so don’t blame me here.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Kawasa''' ka, pinanood mo pa yung nakakaaduwang palabas.|'''It's your doing because''' you watched the disgusting show.}}

