Page 8924 kobrador: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|kubrador}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|es|cobrador}}. {{surf|tl|kobra|-dor|t1=act of collecting debts}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|kobradór}}
* {{rhyme|tl|oɾ|s=3}}
* {{hyph|tl|kob|ra|dor|caption=Syllabification}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|kobradór|f=kobradora|b=+}}

# [[bill]] or [[debt]] [[collector]]
#: {{syn|tl|maniningil|tagasingil|mangongobra}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1994|author=Buenaventura S. Medina|title=Saksi
|passage=BINULAHAW ang tulog ko ng napakaagang '''kubrador''' ni Mr. Miyera, ang pinagkakautangan ni Mrs. Cons ng napakalaking halaga; ang pera ay nagasta sa nawalan ng kabuluhang pagpapagamot sa yumaong Mr. Cons.
|translation=An early debt collector by Mr. Miyera, whom Mr. Constantino has indebted a huge amount to, disturbed my sleep; the money were spent in non-essential health care for the now-deceased Mr. Cons.}}
# {{lb|tl|gambling}} [[bet]] [[collector]] (esp. in ''[[jueteng]]'')
#: {{syn|tl|mangongobra}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2005|title=Sawikaan 2005: mga salita ng taon|page=11|publisher=UP Press|isbn=9789715425155
|passage=Mas marami ngayon ang '''kobrador''' at dumami ang kabo; lumaki ang kita, dumami ang taya o tumataya kahit may implasyon, at lalong lumaki ang suhol sa mga lokal na opisyal ng gobyerno, sa mga pulis at provincial commander , sa mga&nbsp;...
|t=There are more bet collectors and also the chief collectors; more income is flowing in, bets or bettors increased despite inflation, and bribes to local government officials, the police and the provincial commander, etc. increased.}}

====Related terms====
{{rel3|tl|kobransa|mangobra}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
