# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[or]] {{gl|inclusive}}; [[and/or]]
#: {{syn|tl|o}}
#: {{ux|tl|Si Pedro '''kung''' si Juan.|Pedro '''or (could also be)''' Juan.}}
#: {{ux|tl|Kung ikaw at '''kung''' sino ang paroroon?|If you '''and/or''' someone else would be going?}}
#: {{ux|tl|May naaalaman ka bagang anumang tungkol sa pag-aanito, '''kung''' sa asal ng mga mangkukulam, '''kung''' manggagaway?|Do you know anything about idolatry, '''or''' the customs of the witches, '''or as well as''' sorcery?}}

===Preposition===
{{tl-prep|b=+}}

# [[when]]; [[at]] (or [[as soon as]]) that time that; [[if]]
#: {{syn|tl|sa|kapagka|kapag|pagka|pag}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Kung''' gabi, lumalabas ang bituin.|'''At''' night, the stars come out.}}

