# {{lb|tl|vulgar|colloquial|derogatory|offensive}} [[asshole]] {{gl|mean or rude person}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Kupal''' ka; ang samâ ng ginagawa mong paninira sa kapatid mo.|You '''ass'''; that's cruel of you to slander your brother.}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kumupal|kupalin|magpakupal|pagkakupal|napakakupal|mangupal|kuping|kupalan}}

