Page 9494 kustodya: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|kustodiya||custody}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|tl|es|custodia||monstrance}}, from {{der|tl|la|custōdia}}. The more modern definition of "custody" seems to be semantic shift influenced by {{cog|en|custody}}.

