From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*lagúq||to flourish, of plants}}. Possibly related to {{cog|sa|लघु|tr=laghú|t=well; in good health; healthy}}. Compare {{cog|pag|lago||healthy; robust individual}} and {{cog|pam|lagu||beauty; tenderness of plants}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-IPA|lagô}}
* {{hyph|tl|la|go}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|lagô|b=+}}

# [[growth]] of [[plant]]s
#: {{syn|tl|tubo|pagtubo}}
# [[luxuriant]] [[growth]]
#: {{syn|tl|yabong|pagyabong|lamba|paglamba}}
# {{lb|tl|figurative}} [[progress]]; [[development]]; [[growth]]
#: {{syn|tl|unlad|pag-unlad|progreso}}
# [[parrot]] [[seed]] or [[wild]] [[saffron]]

