{{inh+|tl|poz-pro|*dapət||to place in contact with one another, come in contact, space closely}} or {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*rapət||to join together, attach tightly}}. Compare {{cog|id|rapat|t=close; tight}}, {{cog|jv|ꦫꦥꦼꦠ꧀||tightly closed; close; next to}}, {{cog|mg|rafitra|t=carpenter's work, masonry}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|+,lapet<q:colloquial><n^>|lapít,lapét<q:colloquial><a^>|new=1}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[nearness]]; [[proximity]]; [[closeness]]
#: {{syn|tl|kalapitan}}
# [[approaching]] {{gl|of a person or place}}
#: {{syn|tl|dais|pagdais|paglapit}}
# [[seeking]] of [[help]] {{gl|by approaching someone}}
# [[intimacy]]; [[closeness]]
#: {{syn|tl|talik|katalikan}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|kalapitan|kalapit|kalapit-bansa|kalapit-bayan|ilapit|maglapit|lapitan|lumapit|lapit ng loob|lumapit-lapit|maglapit-lapit|magkalapit|magkakalapit|malapit|malapit-lapit|malapitan|palapit|pagkamalapit|paglalapit|paglapit|pinakamalapit}}

====Related terms====
{{rel3|tl|Malapitan}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|dapit|lapat}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|lapít|b=+}}

# [[near]] [[each other]]
#: {{syn|tl|magkalapit|tabi|magkatabi}}

