Page 12030 mama: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh-lite|tl|poz-pro|*mama}}, from {{inh-lite|tl|map-pro|*mamah||father’s brother}}. Also possibly borrowed from {{bor|tl|sa|माम}} or from {{bor|tl|ta|மாமா}}. Compare {{cog-lite|ms|mamak}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA-lite|tl|/ˈmamaʔ/|[ˈmɐ.mɐʔ]}} <!-- {{tl-IPA|mamà}} -->
* {{hyph-lite|tl|ma|ma}}

====Noun====
{{head-lite|tl|nouns|head=mamà|Baybayin spelling|ᜋᜋ|f1sc=Tglg|cat2=terms with Baybayin script}}  <!-- {{tl-noun|mamà|b=ᜋᜋ}} -->

# {{n-g-lite|a term used in referring to, or in addressing, a male unknown to the speaker}}
#: {{syn-lite|tl|mang|manong}}
# {{lb|tl|archaic|familiar}} [[uncle]] (parent's younger brother)
# {{lb|tl|archaic|familiar|childish}} any [[relative]] of the father or mother

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l-lite|tl|mang}}

====See also====
* {{l-lite|tl|ale}}

===Etymology 2===
Each pronunciation has a different source:
* {{IPAchar-lite|/maˈma/}} from {{bor-lite|tl|es|mamá}}, adapted from {{der-lite|tl|fr|maman}}
* {{IPAchar-lite|/ma.ma/}} from {{bor|tl|nan-hbl|媽媽|tr=mâ-mâ}}
* {{IPAchar-lite|/ˈmama/}} from {{bor-lite|tl|en|mama}} / {{m-lite|en|momma}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{hyph-lite|tl|ma|ma}}
* {{IPA-lite|tl|/maˈma/|[mɐˈma]}} <!-- {{tl-IPA|mamá}} --> {{q|Spanish Pronunciation}}
* {{IPA-lite|tl|/mama/|[ma.ma]}} {{q|Hokkien Pronunciation}}
* {{IPA-lite|tl|/ˈmama/|[ˈmɐ.mɐ]}} <!-- {{tl-IPA|mama}} --> {{q|English Pronunciation}}

====Noun====
{{head-lite|tl|nouns|head=mamâ|Baybayin spelling|ᜋᜋ|f1sc=Tglg|cat2=terms with Baybayin script|masculine|papa}} <!-- {{tl-noun|+|head2=mamá|b=ᜋᜋ|m=papa}} --> {{tlb|tl|colloquial|familiar|childish}}

# [[mum]], [[mom]]
#: {{syn-lite|tl|ma|ina|nanay|inay|nay|inang|nanang}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh-lite|tl|phi-pro|*mamaq}}, from {{inh-lite|tl|poz-pro|*mamaq||chew without intending to swallow, as betel nut; premasticate food to give to an infant; premasticated food}}. Compare {{cog|jv|ꦩꦩꦃ}}, and {{cog-lite|ms|mamah}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{hyph-lite|tl|ma|ma}}
* {{IPA-lite|tl|/maˈmaʔ/|[mɐˈmaʔ]}} <!-- {{tl-IPA|mamâ}} -->

====Noun====
