Page 12406 mapa-: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA}}
* {{hyph|tl|ma|pa-}}

===Prefix===
{{tl-head|prefix|b=+}}

# {{n-g|to do something unintentionally; to happen to do something}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|hiya|mapahiya|t1=crying|t2=to cry unintentionally}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|daan|mapadaan|t1=pass by|t2=to happen to pass by}}
# {{n-g|to be able to get someone do something; to be able to have someone do something}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|kain|mapakain|t1=eating|t2=to be able to have someone eat, to be able to feed}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|alis|mapaalis|t1=leaving|t2=to be able to have someone leave}}
# {{n-g|to be able to cause something to change}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|galing|mapagaling|t1=recovery from illness|t2=to be able to have someone recover or heal}}
#: {{prefixusex|tl|kintab|mapakintab|t1=shine|t2=to be able to have something shine, to be able to make something shiny}}
# ''forms an enumerative equivalent to [[whether]] ... [[or]] ...''
#: {{ux|tl|Sasama ako sayo, '''mapa-'''Baguio, '''mapa-'''Cebu, '''mapa-'''kun'san ka man magpunta!|Whether it would be Baguio, or Cebu, or anywhere you go, I would go with you!}}
#: {{ux|tl|Ay jusko mare, sinasabi ko sa'yo! '''Mapa-'''selpon, '''mapa-'''kompyuter, '''mapa-'''playstation man, napakagaling maglaro ng batang 'yon.|Oh, I'm telling you, sister! Whether a phone, a computer, or even a playstation, that child is so focused when it comes to gaming.}}

====Derived terms====
{{prefixsee|tl}}

====Related terms====
{{rel3|tl|napa-}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
-------- end text --------
