===Etymology===
By folk etymology, from {{m|tl|[[Mare]], [[ito]] [[ang]] {{l|en|latest}}|lit=Sis, here's the latest}}, but actually after {{m|tl|Marites}}, the eponymous character in TikTok videos by content creator Justine Luzares in 2020. The senses “buzz; gossip” emerged by 2021.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|márites}}
* {{hyph|tl|ma|ri|tes}}

