* {{desc|es|Manila|bor=1}}
** {{desc|bor=1|en|Manila}}
*** {{desc|bor=1|ja|マニラ}}
** {{desc|bor=1|fr|Manille}}
** {{desc|bor=1|ibl|Manida}}

