* {{cite-book|1=tl|last=Santos|first=Lope K|title=Balarila ng Wikang Pambansa|url=https://kwf.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/Balarila-ng-Wikang-Pambansa-1.pdf|year=1939|isbn=9786218064577|page=112|accessdate=9 June 2023|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20220806165226/https://kwf.gov.ph/wp-content/uploads/Balarila-ng-Wikang-Pambansa-1.pdf|archivedate=6 August 2022}}
