===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA}}
* {{hyph|tl|mu|la|win}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[molave]] (tree, {{taxlink|Vitex parviflora|species}} or {{taxlink|Vitex cofassus|species}} species, and its wood)

====Descendants====
* {{desc|es|molave|bor=1}}
** {{desc|tl|mulabe|bor=1}}
** {{desc|ceb|molave|bor=1}}
** {{desc|en|molave|bor=1}}

