{{clipping|tl}} of {{bor|tl|es|vagamundo}}, rare form of {{m|es|vagabundo}} with influence of {{m|es|mundo||world}}, from {{der|tl|LL.|vagabundus}}. The original word was possibly interpreted to contain the interrogative particle {{m|tl|baga}}. Compare {{cog|ceb|bagamundo}}. {{doublet|tl|bagamundo}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|mundó|b=+}} {{tlb|tl|obsolete}}

# [[vagabondage]]; act of [[wandering]] [[around]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|magmundo}}

=====See also=====
{{col3|tl|lagalag|gala|libot}}

===Further reading===
