===Etymology 1===
From {{bor|tl|es|n}}. Each pronunciation has a different source:
* Filipino alphabet pronunciation is influenced by {{der|tl|en|n}}.
* Abakada alphabet pronunciation is influenced by Baybayin character {{m|tl|{{tl-bay sc|na}}}}.
* Abecedario pronunciation is from {{der|tl|es|n}}.

