Page 13425 naman: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|tl|nman|nmn||text messaging}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|tl|na|man}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|namán}}
* {{hyph|tl|na|man}}

===Particle===
{{tl-head|particle|namán|b=+}}

# {{n-g|used to soften requests}}
#: {{ux|tl|Tulungan mo '''naman''' ako.|Could you,''' please''', help me?}}
# on the other hand
#: {{ux|tl|Pupunta si Miguel sa eskwela. Si Mark '''naman''' ay pupunta sa opisina.|Miguel is going to school. '''On the other hand''', Mark is heading to the office.}}
# {{n-g|particle used to express the turn of somebody or something}}
#: {{ux|tl|Okay, ako '''naman'''!|Okay, it's my '''turn'''!}}
#: {{ux|tl|Sana Vietnam '''naman''' ang manalo sa Miss Universe. Lagi na lang Pilipinas, eh.|I wish Vietnam would win '''this time''' in Miss Universe. It's always been the Philippines.}}
# {{n-g|particle used to emphasize contrast}}
#: {{ux|tl|Sabi nila may pera daw sa lamesa, eh wala '''naman'''!|They told me there's money on the table but there '''really''' was none!}}
#: {{ux|tl|Wala ka '''namang''' sinabi na pupunta ka, ah?|But you '''really''' didn't tell me you were coming!}}
#: {{ux|tl|Maganda siya, pero tamad '''naman'''.|She's pretty, but '''really''' lazy.}}
#: {{ux|tl|Mali 'yung sagot mo sa number 5. — Hindi ah! Tama '''naman''', ah!|Your answer in number 5 is incorrect. — No way! It's correct, '''mind you'''!}}
#: {{ux|tl|Wala '''naman''' akong kasalanan, ah!|But, '''I told you,''' I'm innocent!}}
# {{n-g|particle used to emphasize affirmation}}
#: {{ux|tl|Sasama ka ba sa amin? — Oo '''naman'''!|Are you coming with us? — Yes, '''indeed'''!}}
# {{n-g|particle used to give additional information so the other person will be finally convinced of what you've said or asked}}
#: {{ux|tl|Sabihin mo na sa akin ang sekreto mo. Wala '''namang''' makakaalam na iba, eh.|Tell me that secret of yours already. Nobody else is '''really''' going to know.}}
# {{n-g|particle used in exclamatory sentences to add more emotion}}
#: {{ux|tl|Ang tanga '''naman''' niyun!|'''How''' stupid he was!}}
#: {{ux|tl|Sana mamatay na 'yang gagong 'yan! — Huwag '''naman'''!|I wish that jerk would die! — Oh, not''' at all'''!}}
#: {{ux|tl|Grabe '''naman ''''yung nangyaring lindol sa Japan!|'''How''' outrageous was the earthquake that happened in Japan!}}
#: {{ux|tl|Kawawa '''naman''' 'yung mga namatay sa bagyong Yolanda!|'''How '''pitiful are the victims of typhoon Yolanda!}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|din naman|lang naman|pa naman}}

===Interjection===
{{tl-head|interjection|namán|b=+}}

# [[of course]]!; [[surely]]
#: {{ux|tl|Ang ganda talaga ng Pilipinas. — '''Naman'''!|Philippines is really beautiful. — '''Of course'''!}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}

-------- end text --------
