# {{lb|tl|colloquial|usually|_|derogatory|offensive|ethnic slur}} one with [[dark]] [[pigmentation]] of the [[skin]], such as those of [[African]] descent with [[sub-Saharan]] origin
#: {{syn|tl|nognog|egoy|q1=slang|q2=slang}}
# {{lb|tl|archaic|rare}} [[black]] {{gloss|the color perceived in the absence of light}}

====Usage notes====
* When heard by [[African American]]s visiting or living in the [[Philippines]], the term is often considered offensive due to its derogatory sense in English and associations with the term, [[nigger]], in English, although the term is not used very often due to the meager and sparse population of those of [[sub-Saharan]] origin in the Philippines.

