{{bor+|tl|es|o||or}}, from {{der|tl|la|aut}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|tl|/o/|[o]}}
* {{rhymes|tl|o|s=1}}
* {{hyph|tl|o}}

====Conjunction====
{{head|tl|conjunctions|Baybayin spelling|ᜂ|f1sc=Tglg|cat2=terms with Baybayin script}}

# [[or]]
#: {{syn|tl|o kaya|dili kaya|kung|q3=inclusive, obsolete}}
