===Etymology===
From {{bor|tl|es|p}}. Each pronunciation has a different source:
* Filipino alphabet pronunciation is influenced by {{der|tl|en|p}}.
* Abecedario pronunciation is from {{der|tl|es|p}}.
* Abakada alphabet pronunciation is influenced by Baybayin character {{m|tl|{{tl-bay sc|pa}}}}.

