#: {{ux|tl|Puwede ko bang '''palitan''' ng mas malaki ang una kong sinukat na damit?|Can I '''exchange''' this shirt I fitted with a larger one?|lit=Can the clothes I fitted first '''be exchanged''' by me with a larger one?}}
# to be [[replace]]d
#: {{ux|tl|'''Pinalitan''' ko ang baterya ng remote ng TV.|I '''replaced''' the batteries of the remote control of the television.|lit=The battery of the remote of the TV '''was replaced''' by me.}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Palitan''' mo po yung pundidong bumbilya.|Please '''replace''' that busted bulb.}}

