Page 14633 panahon: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{af|tl|pang-|alt2=*tahon}}, with the root from {{cog|ms|tahun}}, or presumably an older form of {{m|tl|taon}}.<ref>{{R:tl:Potet|NUOT|page=252}}</ref>  {{surf|tl|pang-|taon}}. Compare {{cog|ilo|panawen}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|panahón}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|panahón|b=+}}

# [[time]]
#: {{syn|tl|tiyempo}}
# a [[point]] in time; a [[duration]] of time, [[while]]
#: {{syn|tl|oras|sandali}}
# a [[period]] of time; [[age]]; [[era]]
#: {{uxi|tl|'''Panahong''' Bakal|Iron '''Age'''}}
# [[epoch]]; [[season]]; [[tide]]
#: {{syn|tl|salukoy|q1=obsolete|musim|q2=obsolete}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''panahon''' ng ani|harvest '''season'''}}
#: {{uxi|tl|'''panahon''' ng Pasko|Christmas '''tide'''}}
# [[weather]]
#: {{syn|tl|weder|bayan|q2=obsolete}}
# [[tense]]
#: {{uxi|tl|panghinaharap na '''panahon'''|future '''tense'''}}
# {{lb|tl|obsolete}} [[sowing]] [[period]] {{defdate|16th|17th c.}}

=====Derived terms=====
