From earlier {{m|tl|pangibugho}}, theorized to be {{prefix|tl|pa|ngibugho}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*buʀəhuʔ|t=jealous}}. Alternate theoretical roots include {{m|tl|tibugho}} and {{m|tl|bugho}}. Compare {{cog|ceb|abubho}}, {{cog|war|abugho}}, {{cog|tsg|abughu'}}, and {{cog|ms|cemburu}}. {{doublet|tl|pangimbulo}}.

===Pronunciation===
