===Etymology===
Possibly from {{af|tl|pang-|tahas|t2=direct; courageous}}. However, expected word would be ''*panahas''. Compare {{cog|pam|pangas||hasty}}. See also {{ncog|ceb|kahas}} and {{ncog|hil|kahas}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|pangahás}}
* {{hyph|tl|pa|nga|has}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|pangahás|b=+}}

# [[dare]]; [[audacity]]; [[courage]]
#: {{syn|tl|kawalang-takot|tapang|ngaya|dahas}}
# [[rashness]]; [[recklessness]]
#: {{syn|tl|pusok|dahas}}
# [[presumption]]
#: {{syn|tl|dahas}}

