From {{prefix|tl|pang|arap}}. Compare {{cog|jv|ꦥꦔꦉꦥ꧀ꦲꦉꦥ꧀|tr=pangarep-arep}}, {{cog|ms|pengharapan}}, and {{cog|iba|pengarap}}.

