{{tl-IPA}}
* {{hyph|tl|pa|nga|rap}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[ambition]]; [[dream]] {{gl|hope or wish}}

====Usage notes====
The word {{m-self|tl|pangarap}} is used on dreams that mean hopes and wishes, while {{m-self|tl|panaginip}} is used for dreams that mean visions during sleep.

