{{tl-noun|[[panghalíp]] [[na]] [[dî-tiyák]]|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|grammar}} [[indefinite pronoun]]

====Usage notes====
In Tagalog, indefinite pronouns are formed by adding the particle {{m|tl|man}}, e.g.:

* {{m|tl|anuman}}
* {{m|tl|sinuman}}
* {{m|tl|saanman}}
* {{m|tl|kailanman}}

====See also====
* Tagalog indefinite pronouns at [[:Category:Tagalog indefinite pronouns]]

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}

