From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*pəʀəq}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*pəʀəq}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*pəʀəq||to squeeze out juice}}. Compare {{cog|bcl|puga}}, {{cog|ceb|puga}}, {{cog|ms|perah}}, and {{cog|ch|fugo'}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|pigâ}}
* {{hyph|tl|pi|ga}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|pigâ|b=+}}

# [[squeezing out]] of [[fluid]] from an object {{gl|such as squeezing out juice from fruit, or wringing out water from clothes}}

====Derived terms====
{{col3|tl|ipiga|magpiga|pigaan|pigain|pumiga}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|ekstraksiyon}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}

-------- end text --------
