===Etymology===
{{lit|Pinoy Genius}}. From a segment of the same name since 2004, in the noontime show ''{{w|Eat Bulaga!}}'', the longest running variety show in the Philippines. The segment was later succeeded by ''Gimme 5: Laro ng Mga Henyo'' ({{lit|Gimme 5: Game of the Geniuses|nocap=1}}) and ''Word of the Rings'' by 2023 after the ''Eat Bulaga'' trademark dispute.

