===Etymology===
From {{inh-lite|tl|poz-pro|*puəq}}. Compare {{cog-lite|ms|empu}}, {{cog-lite|id|empu}}, {{cog-lite|kaw|mpu}}. Also possibly from {{clipping|tl|poon|t=lord|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
