Page 15867 pulahan: -------- begin text --------

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|pulahán}}
* {{hyphenation|tl|pu|la|han}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{bor|tl|ceb|pulahan}}, after their use of red robes.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|tl|Pulahan}}
* {{alt|tl|Pulajanes}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|pulahán|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|historical|often|capitalized}} a member of a religious group in the [[Visayas]] that followed a [[syncretic]] form of [[Catholicism]], mixed with ancient Filipino [[animist]] beliefs before the Philippine Revolution
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1990|author=Loren Legarda; Roy C. Iglesias|title=PEP talk: the book
|passage=Bata pa lamang ay sumapi na siya sa mga '''Pulahan''' — isang armadong grupo laban sa administrasyong kolonyal. Nakilala siya bilang manggagamot at guro.
|translation=When he was young, he joined the Pulahan — an armed group against the colonial administration. He was known as a doctor and a teacher.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|pulahanes}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{suffix|tl|pula|-han}}, from the association of red to communism and socialism. First used against the [[Hukbalahap]].

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|pulahán|b=+}}

# {{lb|tl|politics|derogatory}} [[red]]; [[commie]]; [[leftist]]
#: {{syn|tl|komunista|makakaliwa|sosyalista}}
#* {{quote-text|tl|year=1992|author=Dante G. Guevarra|title=Unyonismo sa Pilipinas
|passage=Inakusahan ng mga grupong maka-kaliwa ang mga "dilawan" ng pagdaragdag  ng mga delegado sa listahan, habang pinaratangan naman ng huli ang mga "'''pulahan'''" ng panggugulo sa bulwagan ng kumbensyon.
|translation=The left-wing groups accused the Liberals of adding delegates to the list, while the latter accused the '''reds''' of rioting in the convention center.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1997|author=Amado V. Hernandez|title=Magkabilang Mukha Ng Isang Bagol at Iba Pang Akda|publisher=University of Philippines Press|isbn=9789715421614
|passage=Mga '''pulahan''' sa talaang itim. Sa isang salita, lahat ng unyong manggagawa ng mga company union, lahat ng naghahangad na mabago ang mga progresibo at  rebolusyonaryo.
|t='''Commies''' in the blacklist. In short, all labor unions of company unions, [and] anyone wishing to change how progressives and revolutionaries are viewed.}}

=====Coordinate terms=====
* {{l|tl|dilawan}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
