=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|kapuluan|pulo-pulo|sangkapuluan|Pulong-Bituin}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*puluq}}. Compare {{cog|ms|puluh}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|pulô|b=+}}

# {{obsolete form of|tl|pu}}

=====Usage notes=====
* According to Fr. San José (1610) and Fr. Totanes (1850), '''''pulo''''' was exclusively used when counting in order from one to ten. When asked “How many are there?”, one cannot answer '''''pulo''''', but only {{m|tl|sangpuwo}} (obsolete variant of {{m|tl|sampu}}).

