|passage=If that doesn&#39;t work, try hot water! Let&#39;s see if that doesn&#39;t walce her up! '''Punyeta'''! Cristina assists Monica to the exit. And you, Minerva! Punyeta ka rin! Fix that stupid headdress! And be careful about bumping into the other girls tonight, ha?}}
