===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*putik||mud}}. Compare {{cog|mrw|potik}} and {{cog|mg|fotaka}}. See also {{cog|ilo|pitak}}, {{cog|tsg|pisak}}, and {{cog|ms|becak}}.

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[mud]]
# {{lb|tl|slang|offensive}} a [[nuisance]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|maputik|putikan|magputik|magpaputik|pagputikin|maputikan}}

===Etymology 2===
