{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# {{w|puto maya}} {{gl|a [[rice cake]] [[pastry]] made by [[boil]]ing [[glutinous rice]] in [[coconut milk]] with [[sugar]] and [[grate]]d [[coconut]], as an easier alternative to {{m|tl|puto}}, which is cooked steamed}}

