* Filipino alphabet pronunciation is influenced by {{der|tl|en|r}}.
* Abakada alphabet pronunciation is influenced by Baybayin character {{m-lite|tl|{{tl-bay sc|ra}}|sc=Tglg|tr=da/ra}}.
* Abecedario pronunciation is from {{der|tl|es|r}}.

