#* {{quote-web|tl|date=2018-12-24|author=@Aetalya18|work=Twitter|text=Panis yang••••ulam niyo kung di nyo '''rinef'''. Hmm|t=Your viand will be spoiled if you don't '''refrigerate''' it. Hmm}}
#* {{quote-web|en,tl|year=2022|author=Christine Hazel Cabato|work=YouTube|text=Hi, can I ask po after mixing '''rinef''' nyo po or hindi?|t=Hi, can I respectfully ask if after mixing, did you '''refrigerate''' [it] or not?|title=How to Prepare Ever Whip cream icing{{!}} Super stable icing{{!}} Ever Whip review by Mommy rheine}}
