#* {{quote-web|tl|date=2013-01-13|author=@XYZyrilSntx|work=Askfm|text={{...}}May joke ako. Ref? Ayan yung tawag kapag may ginawa ang lalaki sa babae na hind kaaya-aya. Ex: "Uy, '''RinEF''' niya ako!!!{{...}}|t=I have a joke. Ref? That's what's called when a boy does something to a girl that is not pleasant. Example: "Hey, they '''refrigerated''' me!!!{{...}}"|title=Ano ang Tagalog ng Ref?|trans-title=What is the Tagalog of Ref?}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=2019-12-25|author=@unofficial_kth|work=Twitter|text=Yung tipong pagbukas mo sa ref wala na yung pagkain na '''rinef''' mo...|t=That moment when you opened the refrigerator and the food you '''refrigerated''' is gone...}}
#* {{quote-web|tl|date=2020-12-15|author=@tangomqureen|work=Twitter|text=Guys '''rinef''' ko yung asin 🙂|t=Guys I '''refrigerated''' the salt 🙂}}

