===Etymology===
From {{der|tl|nan-hbl|-}}, possibly either {{m|nan-hbl|司孫|tr=sai-sun|t=grandson of a monk or priest, such as the father having been originally adopted}}<ref>{{R:nan:tdj|49884|e=司孫}}</ref> or {{m|nan-hbl|世孫|tr=sè-sun|t=great-great-great-great-grandson (in a male lineage)}}, via {{bor|tl|es|Sayson}}.

===Pronunciation===
