===Etymology 1===
From Western {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*siraŋ||dazzled, blinded by glaring light}}. Compare {{cog|bcl|sirang||rays or beams of light}} and {{cog|ms|serang||blinking; dazzled}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|hmp=Silang}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[birth]]; [[nativity]]
#: {{syn|tl|pagsilang|pagsisilang|pagiging-tao|pagkakatawang-tao}}
# [[rise]]; [[rising]] {{gl|of the sun, moon, stars, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|pagsilang|sikat|pagsikat}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''silang''' ng araw|'''rising''' of the sun|inline=1}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der3|tl|isilang|magsilang|pagsisilang|sumilang|silangan|pagsilang|sinilangan|kasilanganan|Dulong Silangan|Malayong Silangan|Gitnang Silangan|hilagang-silangan|timog-silangan|pasilangan|Silanganan|silanganin|taga-Silangan|Silangang Davao|Silangang Negros|Silangang Samar|Silangang Timor}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
{{tl-pr|siláng}}

====Noun====
{{tl-noun|siláng|b=+}}

# [[mountain]] [[pass]] or [[trail]]
# [[breeze]] from the [[southeast]]

=====See also=====
* {{l|tl|tinabtab}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:Pambansang Diksiyonaryo}}
