===Etymology===
From {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*sisiw||baby chick}}, from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*siwsiw||to cheep; baby chick}}. Compare {{cog|pag|siwsiw}}, {{cog|kyj|sisiw}}, {{cog|xsb|sisiw}}, {{cog|pam|sisi}}, {{cog|bcl|siwo}} / {{m|bcl|siyo}}, {{cog|akl|isiw}}, {{cog|msk|osoy}}, and {{cog|ami|ciwciw}}.

