{{tl-IPA}}
* {{hyph|tl|si|siw}}

===Noun===
{{tl-noun|b=+}}

# [[chick]]; [[young]] [[chicken]]
#: {{syn|tl|kiti}}
# {{lb|tl|slang}} [[child's play]] {{gl|something [[simple]] or [[easy]]}}
#: {{syn|tl|tsiken|q1=slang|mani|q2=colloquial}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|tl|basang-sisiw}}

====See also====
{{col3|tl|siyap|inakay}}

===Adjective===
