* {{alt|tl|Songsong||obsolete|Abecedario}}

===Etymology===
Two proposed etymologies:
* A {{reduplication|tl||nocap=1}} of {{der|tl|nan-hbl|宋|tr=sòng}}, in relation to the [[Song dynasty]].<ref>{{R:tl:Potet|TBC|page=341}}</ref>
* From {{m|tl|sungsong}}, from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*suŋsuŋ||go against wind or current}}. The attribution to China is presumably connected with sailing problems in reaching mainland China from the Philippines, according to Blust and Trussel (2010).<ref>{{R:map:ACD|suŋsuŋ₁}}</ref>

