Page 18458 Tagaytay: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
From {{m|tl|tagaytay||mountain ridge}}, referring to the mountain ridge near Mount Sungay overlooking Taal Lake. By folk etymology, from "{{m|tl|taga}}'','' {{m|tl|itay}}''!''", referring to the yells of a boy (with his father, hunting in the forest) that echoed on the mountains on the present location of the city.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|Tagaytáy}}
* {{hyph|tl|Ta|gay|tay}}

===Proper noun===
{{tl-proper noun|Tagaytáy|b=+}}

# {{place|tl|city|p/Cavite|c/Philippines|t=Tagaytay}}
