# to [[estimate]]; to [[calculate]]
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=2017|author=J. Neil C. Garcia; Danton Remoto|title=Ladlad: An Anthology of Philippine Gay Writing|publisher=Anvil Publishing, Incorporated via PublishDrive|isbn=9789712733352
|passage='''Tinantiya''' ko ang oras na wala ng tao sa burol ni Par. At saka ako nagpunta. Pero  marami pa ring tao. Ang iba&#39;y nakahiga na sa silya. Ang iba nama&#39;y nagbabaraha  pa. May mga kapampangang babae na nasa gilid ng iskinita.
|t=I estimated the time that there are no more people on Par's funeral. And I soon went there. But there are still a lot of people. Others are already asleep in their chairs. The other ones are playing. There are Kapampangan women in the side of the alley.}}
# to [[weigh up]]; to [[make]] an [[assessment]] {{gl|as of someone's ability, etc.}}
#: {{syn|tl|pakiramdaman}}

