Page 19003 tatlo: -------- begin text --------
{{number box|tl}}

===Etymology===
From Proto-Central Philippine ''*tatlu'' (compare {{cog|akl|tatlo}}, {{cog|cts|tatlo}}, and {{cog|hil|tatlo}}), from {{inh|tl|phi-pro|*tatlu}} (compare {{cog|bcl|tulo}}, {{cog|ceb|tulo}}, {{cog|mba|tatulo}}, {{cog|ilo|tallo}}, {{cog|mdh|telu}}, {{cog|mrw|telo}}, and {{cog|tao|atlo}}), from {{inh|tl|poz-pro|*təlu|*ta-təlu}} (compare {{cog|ch|tulu}}, {{cog|fj|tolu}}, {{cog|jv|ꦠꦼꦭꦸ}}, {{cog|mg|telo}}, {{cog|ms|telu}}, {{cog|mi|toru}}, and {{cog|tet|tolu}}), from {{inh|tl|map-pro|*təlu|*ta-təlu}} (compare {{cog|ami|tolo}}, {{cog|dru|tulru}}, and {{cog|pwn|tjelu}}). {{doublet|tl|atlo|itlo}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{tl-IPA|tatló}}
* {{hyph|tl|tat|lo}}
* {{audio|tl|TL-PH-tatlo.ogg|Audio}}

===Numeral===
{{tl-num|tatló|b=+}}

# {{cln|tl|cardinal numbers}} [[three]]
#: {{syn|tl|tres|atlo|itlo|mampat|q2=obsolete|q3=obsolete|q4=obsolete}}

====Usage notes====
* To describe the quantity of something, the number is placed before the noun and affixed with a '''-ng''' when the word ends with a vowel, and a separate word '''[[na]]''' for a consonant.
*: {{ux|tl|'''Isang''' saging, '''dalawang''' pinya|'''One''' banana, '''two''' pineapples}}
*: {{ux|tl|'''Apat na''' mansanas, '''anim na''' mangga|'''One''' apple, '''six''' mangos}}

====Derived terms====
{{der3|tl|tatluhan|tatluhin|tatlundaan|tatlumpu|tatlunlibo|ikatlo|makatatlo|tigtatatlo|pagtatatlo|labintatlo|ikatatlumpu|pangatlumpu|pangatlo|ikalabintatlo|panlabintatlo|tatlo-tatluhan|tatlumpu't anim|tatlumpu't apat|tatlumpu't dalawa|tatlumpu't isa|tatlumpu't lima|tatlumpu't pito|tatlumpu't siyam|tatlumpu't tatlo|tatlumpu't walo|dalawampu't tatlo|apatnapu't tatlo|limampu't tatlo|animnapu't tatlo|pitumpu't tatlo|walumpu't tatlo|siyamnapu't tatlo|saikatlo|katlo|sangkatlo|Tatlong Hari|tatlong-kapat|tatsulok|tatsiha|tatsihaan|Santatlo|Banal na Santatlo|pagtatluhin|tatlo-tatlo|tatatlo|tigatlo|tatlumpuin|tatlumpuan|tatlong-baraha|tatlong-didal|tatlong-palad|tatlo't wala|kamakatlo|tatatluhin|tatlong-didal|tatlong-baraha|pangatlong batis|Katatluhan|tumatlo|Tatlonghari|Pista ng Tatlong Hari}}
