* From {{m|tl|tayaba||a local practice of {{m|tl|igba}} for planting crops}}.<ref>{{cite-web|en|url=https://studylib.net/doc/8332213/compiled-and-edited-by-the-office-of-the-municipal|title=Compiled and Edited by the Office of the Municipal|work=studylib.net|accessdate=2023-05-30}}</ref>
* From {{m|tl|tagabas||native fern}}
* From {{m|tl|tayaban||night creature known for having wings that glow like a tropical firefly}}.<ref>{{cite-web|en|titleurl=https://tayabas.gov.ph/history-of-tayabas/|title=History of Tayabas – City of Tayabas Website|work=tayabas.gov.ph|accessdate=2024-02-19}}</ref>

