* {{cite-book|author=Venancio M. de Abella|title=Vade-Mecum Filipino ó manual de la conversacion familiar Español-Tagalog|url=https://books.google.de/books?hl=it&id=SHI4BxjWX1YC&dq=cha+espa%C3%B1ol+filipino&q=cha#v=onepage&q=cha&f=false|year=1874|location=Escolta, Manila|publisher=Ramirez y Giraudier|edition=12.ᵃ|worklang=es, tl|page=115}}
* {{R:es:DRAE|cha}}

