#: {{syn|tl|lusaw|tignas|tugnas|lapunaw}}
# [[dissolved]]; [[digested]] {{gl|of food in the stomach}}
# {{lb|tl|astronomy|obsolete}} [[fully]] [[wane]]d; in [[conjunction]] with the [[Sun]] {{gl|of the moon}}
