===Pronunciation===
{{tl-pr|ubós<a^>|+<n^>|new=1}}

===Adjective===
{{tl-adj|ubós|b=+}}

# [[used up]]; [[consumed]]
#: {{syn|tl|said|simot}}
#: {{ux|tl|'''Ubos''' na ang pera ko.|My money is '''all gone'''.}}

