|translation=He is a former employee at the Hotel Inter-continental Manila and he became a devout trade unionist in the time when violence is prevalent especially against the worker's bloc.}}
#* {{quote-book|tl|year=1995|author=Dante G. Guevarra|title=Manggagawa sa kasaysayan|publisher=Rex Bookstore, Inc.|isbn=9789712317569|page=53
|passage=Gayunman, agad nalantad ito sa iba pang mga unyonista na may makabayang mga paninindigan at nakaunawa ng usapin ng “dilawan” at tunay na '''unyonismo'''.
|t=Therefore, it was immediately revealed to the other trade unionists who have patriotic commitments and understand the issue with the ''dilawan'' [liberals] and true trade unionism.}}

